{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kat and Mat are two cats living peacefully in their cozy home\u2026 until one day, a mysterious stranger appears, leaving behind strange floating bouncing balls and kidnapping Mat\u2014vanishing into the sky. Is this some kind of test for little Kat? Whatever it is, she\u2019s determined to climb as high as it takes to bring Mat back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce Cat</strong> is a challenging platformer where every jump matters, and every bounce could bring you closer to the top\u2026 or send you all the way back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Jump and bounce with precision to ascend through a vertical world<br>\u2013 One small mistake could mean a huge fall<br>\u2013 Addictive and demanding gameplay with a rewarding learning curve<br>\u2013 Take a break from climbing and meow your own melodies with a unique music system<br>\u2013 Paw at different objects to knock them down and collect them all<br>\u2013 Discover hidden areas and unlock adorable outfits for Kat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a vertical adventure with a feline heart, where the challenge lies in every jump\u2026 and the reward is never giving up.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shattered Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664230/ee85c28cc136e66517f2dfdbe447442c3566393d.jpg"},{"name":"First Collectible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664230/d86daee5651707a5fcf19060641f1ceb12ecda6a.jpg"},{"name":"Amethyst Crystal Cavern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664230/e0dc420d304d29a5ab801f4a31097addcc6542b3.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Dew Hollows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664230/cc9fe6f69c67d7766b4c5fb21444ba732ff28220.jpg"},{"name":"Whispering Swamp","pa